              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, light armour, thrusting spear or throwing spear, composite bow and shield. May ride a horse (+10) and has heavy armour if mounted. Army General.</characteristic>
