              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Nobles have hand weapon, light armour, thrusting spear and composite bow. May have throwing spear instead of thrusting spear (free), heavy armour (+1) and shield (+1). Light Cavalry. Nomad Cavalry.</characteristic>
