              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Horse archers have hand weapon and composite bow. May have javelins (+1), throwing spear (+3), buckler (free) or shield (+1). Light Cavalry. Nomad Cavalry. There must be at least two units of horse archers in the army.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
